aptions-edge-style-vjs_video_1903_component_2467\">Text Edge Style</legend><select id=\"vjs_select_2563\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-edge-style-vjs_video_1903_component_2467\"><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2564-None\" value=\"none\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-edge-style-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2564-None\">None</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2565-Raised\" value=\"raised\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-edge-style-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2565-Raised\">Raised</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2566-Depressed\" value=\"depressed\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-edge-style-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2566-Depressed\">Depressed</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2567-Uniform\" value=\"uniform\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-edge-style-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2567-Uniform\">Uniform</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2568-Dropshadow\" value=\"dropshadow\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-edge-style-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2568-Dropshadow\">Drop shadow</option></select></fieldset><fieldset class=\"vjs-font-family vjs-track-setting\"><legend id=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1903_component_2467\">Font Family</legend><select id=\"vjs_select_2578\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1903_component_2467\"><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2579-ProportionalSansSerif\" value=\"proportionalSansSerif\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2579-ProportionalSansSerif\">Proportional Sans-Serif</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2580-MonospaceSansSerif\" value=\"monospaceSansSerif\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2580-MonospaceSansSerif\">Monospace Sans-Serif</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2581-ProportionalSerif\" value=\"proportionalSerif\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2581-ProportionalSerif\">Proportional Serif</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2582-MonospaceSerif\" value=\"monospaceSerif\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2582-MonospaceSerif\">Monospace Serif</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2583-Casual\" value=\"casual\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2583-Casual\">Casual</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2584-Script\" value=\"script\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2584-Script\">Script</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2585-SmallCaps\" value=\"small-caps\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2585-SmallCaps\">Small Caps</option></select></fieldset></div><div class=\"vjs-track-settings-controls\"><button class=\"vjs-default-button\" type=\"button\" title=\"restore all settings to the default values\" aria-disabled=\"false\">Reset</button><button class=\"vjs-done-button\" type=\"button\" title=\"Done\" aria-disabled=\"false\">Done</button></div></div><button class=\"vjs-close-button vjs-control vjs-button\" type=\"button\" title=\"Close Modal Dialog\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"vjs-icon-placeholder\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"vjs-control-text\" aria-live=\"polite\">Close Modal Dialog</span></button><p class=\"vjs-control-text\">End of dialog window.</p></div></video-js></div></div></div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">集成流程概述</h2>\n<div>在开始集成Stripe支付之前，让我们先了解完整的操作流程：</div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">前置准备</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<div><strong>注册香港公司</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li>通过可靠的代办公司进行注册（约1周时间）</li>\n<li>费用：注册约5000港币</li>\n<li>年度维护费用：4000-5000港币</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><strong>开设香港公司银行账户</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li>可使用空中云汇（Airwallex）</li>\n<li>直接注册云汇账号并填写公司信息</li>\n<li>注意：新公司可能需要支付开户费用</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">Stripe集成步骤</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<div><strong>创建和验证Stripe账户</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li>注册Stripe账户</li>\n<li>完成KYC（个人身份认证）</li>\n<li>完成KYB（企业认证）</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><strong>沙盒环境配置</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li>创建测试产品</li>\n<li>获取测试支付链接</li>\n<li>配置测试环境API密钥</li>\n<li>设置测试Webhook</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><strong>技术实现</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li>配置环境变量（API Secret Key）</li>\n<li>配置Webhook端点</li>\n<li>开发支付功能代码</li>\n<li>集成支付链接</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><strong>测试验证</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li>在沙盒模式下测试支付流程</li>\n<li>验证Webhook回调</li>\n<li>测试错误处理</li>\n<li>确认支付流程完整性</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><strong>正式环境部署</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li>替换正式环境API Secret Key</li>\n<li>更新正式环境Webhook配置</li>\n<li>验证生产环境支付流程</li>\n<li>监控支付状态</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<div>让我们按照上述步骤，详细了解每个环节的具体实现。</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">1. 创建和配置账户</h2>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">1.1 注册账户</h3>\n<div>首先，你需要创建一个Stripe账户：\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img1.webp\" alt=\"创建账户\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">1.2 了解支付方式</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<div>一次性支付功能介绍：\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img2.webp\" alt=\"一次性支付介绍\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>设置一次性支付：\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img3.webp\" alt=\"设置一次性支付\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>了解支付链接：\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img4.webp\" alt=\"支付链接说明\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">2. 创建产品和支付链接</h2>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">2.1 设置产品</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<div>创建一次性产品：\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img5.webp\" alt=\"创建产品\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>添加产品信息：\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img6.webp\" alt=\"添加产品\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img7.webp\" alt=\"cursor添加产品\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">2.2 配置支付链接</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>创建支付链接：</li>\n</ol>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img8.webp\" alt=\"创建支付链接\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li>\n<div>设置支付页面：\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img9.webp\" alt=\"支付页面设置\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>配置支付后行为：\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img10.webp\" alt=\"支付后配置\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>获取支付链接：\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img11.webp\" alt=\"获取支付链接\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">3. 完善商业信息</h2>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">3.1 验证商业资料</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<div>验证商业档案：\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img12.webp\" alt=\"验证商业档案\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>填写商业详情：\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img13.webp\" alt=\"商业详情\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>设置税收计算：\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img14.webp\" alt=\"税收设置\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>提交审核：\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img15.webp\" alt=\"提交审核\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">3.2 沙箱环境配置</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<div>复制沙箱设置：\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img16.webp\" alt=\"复制沙箱\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>沙箱配置：\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img17.webp\" alt=\"沙箱设置\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">3.3 产品管理</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<div>查看产品目录：\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img18.webp\" alt=\"产品目录\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>分享支付链接：\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img19.webp\" alt=\"分享链接\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">4. API和Webhook配置</h2>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">4.1 API密钥设置</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>获取API密钥：\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img20.webp\" alt=\"API密钥\" loading=\"lazy\"></li>\n</ol>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">4.2 Webhook配置</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<div>Webhook介绍：\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img21.webp\" alt=\"Webhook介绍\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>本地测试说明：\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img22.webp\" alt=\"本地测试\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>配置本地监听器：\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img23.webp\" alt=\"设置监听器\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>监听器配置步骤：\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img24.webp\" alt=\"步骤1\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img25.webp\" alt=\"步骤2\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img26.webp\" alt=\"步骤3\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img27.webp\" alt=\"步骤4\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">4.3 在线支付配置</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<div>获取在线支付链接：\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img28.webp\" alt=\"在线支付链接\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>配置Webhook端点：\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img29.webp\" alt=\"添加Webhook端点\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img30.webp\" alt=\"选择事件\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img31.webp\" alt=\"选择目标类型\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img32.webp\" alt=\"配置目标\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img33.webp\" alt=\"复制密钥\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">4.4 支付方式和部署</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<div>启用支付宝和微信支付：\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img34.webp\" alt=\"启用支付方式\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>Vercel环境变量配置：\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img35.webp\" alt=\"Vercel配置\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">5. 代码实现</h2>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">环境变量配置</h3>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-env\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_xxxxx\n</span>STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_xxxxx</code></div></pre>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">用Cursor写支付功能</h3>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img36.webp\" alt=\"Vercel配置\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h1po1vth8u_img37.webp\" alt=\"Vercel配置\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">6. 测试</h2>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">6.1 测试卡号</h3>\n<div>使用以下测试卡号进行支付测试：</div>\n<ul>\n<li>成功支付: 4242 4242 4242 4242</li>\n<li>需要认证: 4000 0025 0000 3155</li>\n<li>支付失败: 4000 0000 0000 9995</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">6.2 本地Webhook测试</h3>\n<div>使用Stripe CLI测试Webhook：</div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-bash\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>stripe listen --forward-to localhost:3000/api/webhook</span></code></div></pre>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">相关资源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ag7HXbgJtuk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Stripe支付教程视频</a></li>\n</ul>",
